flowchart TD
  Start[Invoke CLI generation command] --> Git{Find .git project root?}
  Git -->|Yes| Root[Use Git project root as working scope]
  Git -->|No| Cwd[Use invocation directory as working scope]
  Root --> Source[Locate canonical YAML]
  Cwd --> Source
  Source --> Parse[Parse and validate]
  Parse --> Resolve[Resolve built-in or cached services]
  Resolve --> Convert[Generate selected targets]
  Convert --> Existing{Would output overwrite manual changes?}
  Existing -->|Yes| Stop[Stop / require explicit safe resolution]
  Existing -->|No| Write[Write atomically]
